        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;CloudPilot – Entity Relationship Diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Crow&#39;s foot: child end = many (N), parent end = exactly one (1); ERzeroToOne = 0..1 / nullable FK.&lt;br/&gt;Red thick edges = critical traceability chain (Team→Project→Repository→Commit→Deployment→Steps/Resources; Project→Incident→HealingAction→Approval).&lt;br/&gt;Colors: blue=Identity/AWS, green=Source and analysis, purple=Architecture and AI agents, orange=Deployment, yellow=Monitoring, red=Incidents/Self-healing, gray=Cost.&lt;br/&gt;Future (not in v1): KnowledgeDocument(project_id NULL) 1:N DocumentChunk(embedding VECTOR) via pgvector. Never store AWS secrets in PostgreSQL." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="1800" x="10" y="-220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
